        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "La Nua is nestled in the foothills of Mount Gabriel, a distance of 1.5 miles from Schull and within a few minutes drive to the sea. This property enjoys private rural landscape surroundings. La Nua can be enjoyed year round and has individual style and charm. The size of the interior cannot be fully appreciated from the perspective of the pleasant exterior. Inside the front door, the large hallway has plenty of room for storing outdoor items.\r\nThe living room contains a large stove (with back-boiler) centre to a very cosy family living room. The master bedroom, with its vaulted ceiling is large enough for any size bed, with beautiful reclaimed brass wall light fixtures and a ceiling candelabra decorate this simple yet highly impressive room. Several opportunities in this room to make changes if desired.\r\n\r\nThere is a wonderful flow from room to room in this house. There is an impressive sunroom containing a pleasant office space in this room, with high speed broad band. The kitchen contains a large fridge & a small fridge, one medium-sized freezer, 4-ring gas cooker, microwave oven, & dishwasher. A sheltered sun-trapped patio is directly outside the kitchen door. A pergola leads the way down to the large back garden and guest apt from here.\r\n\r\nOther property features:\r\n- Unique country residence meticulously restored over an extended period.\r\n- 300 Mb High Speed Fibre Broadband\r\n- Elevated Deck to Rear of property with views to Mt Gabriel.\r\n- Water system - Filtered water system installed in 2018\r\n- Heating throughout house installed in 2016\r\n- A Hive system allows remote (phone/PC) control of the heating, hot water and security lights.\r\n- Graveled driveway with ample parking for several cars and boat trailers etc.\r\n- c. 0.61 acre plot.\r\n\r\nAccommodation:\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway: Coir carpet, feature window (1.8m x 1.6m)\r\nInner Hallway: Reclaimed hardwood flooring (4.6m x 1.2m)\r\nWash Room: L-shaped - wash hand basin, wc with large storage closet (1.9m x 2.4m) (1.8m x 0.8m)\r\nBathroom: L-shaped - wooden wainscoting, vanity unit, bath, shower (3.3m x 2.6m)\r\nLiving Room: Wooden floor, open fireplace with feature beam, door to kitchen, new large stove with back-boiler (7.9m x 4.5m)\r\nBedroom 1: Wooden floor, vaulted ceiling with exposed roof beams, west facing windows, feature windows, access to attic (9.5m x 3.5m)\r\nConservatory: Stone faced wall, paved floor, glass roof, south and west-facing windows (3.15m x 7.8m)\r\nKitchen/Dining Area: Traditional style plastering, kitchen units, 1.5 drainer sink, dishwasher, washing machine, doorway to conservatory, stove (8.3m x 3.3m)\r\nBedroom 2: Bifold doors, day double bed, 1 velux window with blind (2.2m x 2.2m)\r\n\r\nGuest Apartment: 1 bed apartment, 2 velux windows with blinds (5.2m x 2.5m)\r\nEnsuite, electric shower: (1.8m x 2.5m)\r\n\r\nAll information is provided in good faith and believed to be correct; however, it is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No representations or warranties, express or implied, are made as to the accuracy, completeness, condition, or planning status of the property.\r\nInterested parties should investigate independently as to the accuracy of all details, including measurements, boundaries, area, BER rating, and available services. In addition, all apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services should be thoroughly tested to asses their working condition.\r\nPhotographs and videos are for guidance purposes only and may show items (such as furniture) that are not included in the sale unless specifically agreed between the parties."
